        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The entity responsible for publishing the dataset, referenced from the EU Corporate body authority table (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/corporate-body). Use of this vocabulary is recommended; other values, such as a national organisation not listed there, are tolerated."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message": [
