        "@value": "The geographical coverage of the dataset, taken from the EU authority tables for Continent (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/continent), Countries and territories (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country) or Place (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/place), or from GeoNames. Use of these vocabularies is recommended; other values are tolerated."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message": [
